];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tote Bag Blacu Custom Seminar & Event: Katalog Model & Harga Pabrik"
  description="Katalog tote bag blacu custom langsung dari konveksi workshop Malang. Pilihan bahan blacu super grade A, jahitan kuat, sablon manual atau DTF, harga mulai Rp 12.000, MOQ 50 pcs."
  canonicalUrl="https://totebag.web.id/produk/tote-bag-blacu/"
  ogImage="https://totebag.web.id/media/tote-bag-blacu-polos.webp"
  jsonLd={schemaJson}
>
  <!-- Topbar Announcement Strip -->
  <aside class="blacu-topbar py-2 text-center text-white small" style="background-color: var(--brand-primary, #173F38);" aria-label="Informasi konveksi blacu">
    <div class="container">
      Konveksi Tote Bag Blacu Super Grade A • Serat Kapas Alami Bernapas • Garansi Sablon Presisi &amp; Kirim Seluruh Indonesia
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs & Quick-Nav In-Page Navigation -->
  <div class="container pt-3">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />
    <nav class="quick-nav d-none d-md-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 pb-1" aria-label="Navigasi cepat halaman blacu">
      <span class="small fw-semibold text-muted align-self-center me-1">Lompat ke:</span>
      <a href="#katalog-produk" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Katalog Model &amp; Harga</a>
      <a href="#tabel-harga" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Tabel Harga Grosir</a>
      <a href="#keunggulan" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Karakteristik Blacu</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">FAQ</a>
      <a href="#penawaran" class="badge badge-cta bg-brand text-white text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill shadow-sm">Minta Penawaran</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Header Section -->
  <section class="section-space-sm pt-3 pb-4 hero-blacu" id="konten">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-lg-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="badge-accent">KATALOG PRODUK &amp; KONVEKSI BLACU</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title mb-3">
            Tote Bag Blacu Custom: Pilihan Model, Ukuran &amp; Harga Pabrik
          </h1>

          <p class="lead text-muted fs-5 mb-3" style="line-height: 1.7;">
            Tote bag blacu super grade A dengan serat katun alami warna broken white hangat. Pilihan paling populer untuk seminar nasional, workshop kampus, dan souvenir instansi yang menginginkan tas bernuansa alami, rapi, dan sangat efisien biaya.
          </p>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="#katalog-produk" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
              Lihat 4 Model Produk ↓
            </a>
            <a href="#penawaran" class="btn btn-brand-outline btn-lg">
              Konsultasi WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-muted small">
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Mulai Rp 12.000 / pcs (MOQ 50 pcs)</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Blacu Super Grade A Tenunan Rapat</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Muat Stopmap A4 &amp; Binder Seminar</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Sablon Manual Rubber &amp; DTF Tajam</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="position-relative">
            <div class="ratio ratio-4x3 rounded-4 overflow-hidden border shadow-sm">
              <img 
                src="/media/tote-bag-blacu-polos.webp" 
                alt="Tote bag blacu polos warna broken white alami untuk seminar dan event" 
                width="800" 
                height="600" 
                class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 m-3 px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm border text-dark d-none d-sm-block" style="max-width: 250px; z-index: 5;">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="badge rounded-circle p-1 bg-success text-white" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px;">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="d-block text-brand fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.2;">Blacu Super Grade A</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.2;">Serat Rapat • Tidak Menerawang</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARKETPLACE CATALOG SECTION (Tampil Langsung di Depan) -->
  <section class="section-space pt-2 pb-5" id="katalog-produk">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="badge-accent mb-2">PILIHAN MODEL SIAP ORDER</span>
          <h2 class="section-title mb-1">Katalog Model Tote Bag Blacu</h2>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Semua model diproduksi langsung di workshop konveksi kami di Malang dengan garansi pengerjaan rapi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 mt-md-0">
          <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border px-3 py-2 rounded-pill small">MOQ Standar: 50 Pcs per Desain</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid 4 Model Marketplace Cards -->
      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        {blacuModels.map(item => (
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <article class="card h-100 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm overflow-hidden d-flex flex-column">
              <!-- Product Image Wrapper -->
              <div class="position-relative overflow-hidden border-bottom">
                <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="d-block ratio ratio-4x3 bg-light text-decoration-none">
                  <img 
                    src={item.image} 
                    alt={`${item.name} bahan blacu super custom logo`}
                    width="600" 
                    height="450" 
                    class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </a>
                <span class={`position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3 badge ${item.badgeClass} rounded-pill shadow-sm`} style="font-size: 0.75rem; z-index: 2;">
                  {item.badge}
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Product Details -->
              <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                  <span class="text-muted small fw-bold">{item.code} • {item.category}</span>
                  <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border small">MOQ {item.moq}</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">
                  <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="text-decoration-none text-dark hover-brand">
                    {item.name}
                  </a>
                </h3>

                <div class="p-2 mb-3 rounded-2 bg-surface-alt border">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Bahan Kain:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.material}</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Ukuran Standar:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.dimensions}</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                  <div class="text-muted small fw-bold mb-1">Spesifikasi Fitur:</div>
                  <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-1">
                    {item.features.map(f => (
                      <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1">
                        <span class="text-success fw-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>{f}</span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-3 border-top">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-baseline mb-3">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Mulai dari:</span>
                      <div class="h4 fw-bold text-brand mb-0">{item.price} <small class="text-muted fw-normal" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">/ pcs</small></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="small text-muted text-end">{item.priceRange}</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <a 
                      href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} 
                      class="btn btn-outline-dark flex-grow-1 text-center py-2"
                      style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;"
                    >
                      Detail Produk
                    </a>
                    <a 
                      href={`https://wa.me/6282131087971?text=${encodeURIComponent(item.waMessage)}`} 
                      target="_blank" 
                      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                      class="btn btn-brand flex-grow-1 text-center py-2"
                      style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;"
                    >
                      Minta Penawaran
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel Skala Harga Grosir Blacu -->
      <div class="p-4 p-lg-5 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm mb-4" id="tabel-harga">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1">Tabel Skala Harga Grosir Tote Bag Blacu</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Biaya per pcs semakin hemat seiring bertambahnya volume order berkat efisiensi potong kain dan plat sablon.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mt-2 mt-md-0">Pabrik Konveksi Langsung</span>
        </div>

        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table table-bordered table-specs align-middle mb-0">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Model &amp; Spesifikasi Blacu</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">50 - 99 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">100 - 299 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">300 - 499 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center bg-success-subtle">500 - 999 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center bg-success text-white">1.000+ Pcs</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>BLA-01</strong> Flat Classic Blacu Super (30 x 40 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 12.000</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 10.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 9.500</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 9.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 8.500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>BLA-02</strong> Blacu Gusset Alas Bawah (35 x 40 x 8 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 15.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 13.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 12.500</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 12.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 11.500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>BLA-03</strong> Blacu Kombinasi Saku Depan Fungsional</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 17.000</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 15.000</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 14.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 13.500</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 13.000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>BLA-04</strong> Blacu Resleting YKK &amp; Kancing Magnet</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 18.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 16.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 15.500</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 15.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 14.500</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-muted mt-3 mb-0">
          *Harga sudah termasuk sablon manual rubber 1 warna 1 sisi. Penambahan warna sablon atau cetak DTF fullcolor dapat dikonfirmasi saat penyerahan desain.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KARAKTERISTIK BLACU SUPER -->
  <section class="section-space bg-surface-alt" id="keunggulan">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-75 mb-4">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-2">KARAKTERISTIK KAIN</span>
